.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH soundcraft-cli-script 1  "script " 
.SH NAME
soundcraft\-cli\-script \- Run a file of engine commands, one `ID JSON` per line
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsoundcraft\-cli script\fR [\fB\-\-keep\-going\fR] [\fB\-\-in\fR] [\fB\-\-demo\fR] [\fB\-\-bounce\fR] [\fB\-\-start\fR] [\fB\-\-end\fR] [\fB\-\-save\fR] [\fB\-\-inspect\fR] [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-\-in\-place\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a file of engine commands, one `ID JSON` per line
.PP
Blank lines and lines starting with # are skipped. A failing line stops the script unless \-\-keep\-going is given.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-going\fR
Continue after command errors and finish requested output, then exit nonzero if any command failed. Malformed JSON stops immediately
.TP
\fB\-\-in\fR \fI<S.scraft>\fR
Open this session first
.TP
\fB\-\-demo\fR
Start from the demo session
.TP
\fB\-\-bounce\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Bounce the mix to this file at the end; without \-\-start and \-\-end, the whole session
.TP
\fB\-\-start\fR \fI<T>\fR
Where the bounce starts: seconds (12.5) or a time string
.TP
\fB\-\-end\fR \fI<T>\fR
Where the bounce ends: seconds (12.5) or a time string
.TP
\fB\-\-save\fR \fI<S.scraft>\fR
Save the session to this file at the end, replacing it
.TP
\fB\-\-inspect\fR
Print the session as JSON at the end
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
Print the \-\-inspect JSON on one line instead of pretty\-printed
.TP
\fB\-\-in\-place\fR
Allow a \-\-save that is the \-\-in session, replacing the original
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
The script to run
